{"title":"Accessories","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"collar-power-bank","title":"Collar Power Bank","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Collar Power Bank is a 2850 mAh battery designed specifically for Vuzix Smart Glasses. It offers ten times the battery capacity of Blade Smart Glasses for 10 hours of run time under normal operation. The battery is worn around the neck to comfortably and conveniently extend device usage. It also provides pass-through audio from the Vuzix Blade Model 447 to headphones. Note: Vuzix Blade Model 494 cannot use the pass-through audio.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865740062886,"sku":"447T0A006","price":99.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/Product_Image_Vuzix_Accessories_collar1.png?v=1628086943"},{"product_id":"vuzix-blade-sunglasses-clip-on","title":"Vuzix Blade™ Sunglasses Clip-on","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTAC polarized lenses are thinner than ordinary PC or AC lenses, only about 0.74mm in thickness but more durable and flexible than ordinary PC or AC lenses. Normal sunglasses lenses can only reduce sunlight, but polarized lenses can reduce the glare from sunlight, especially the glare from the surface of roads, lakes and windows. These rimless clip on sunglasses are designed to fit over the Vuzix Blade, and flip up when you don't need them.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUV-400 Lenses provide 100% UV protection and anti-glare from sunlight.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Specifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eClip Material: Metal \u0026amp; TR90 plastic; Lens Material: UV400 TAC polarized; Lens Size: 60x40mm(2.36x1.57 in).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eIncludes 1 polarized clip-on sunglasses, 1 cleaning cloth, 1 PVC case.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarnings:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eDo not look directly at the sun. Do not use while driving at night.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865740521638,"sku":"447T0A005","price":24.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/Vuzix_Blade_Sunglasses_Clip_on.jpg?v=1628086949"},{"product_id":"m-series-safety-frame-mounting-clips","title":"M-Series Safety Frame Mounting Clips (L\u0026R)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eReplacement mounting clips (frame not included) for attaching to M-Series lensless frames. Set includes left and right side clips with the custom Vuzix rail mounting system, allowing for right or left eye mounting with 30 degree rotation of the main M-Series Smart Glasses.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865740587174,"sku":"446T0A006","price":19.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/M_series_safety_frame_mounting_clips.jpg?v=1628086950"},{"product_id":"headset-mount-peltor","title":"Headset Mount, Peltor","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFor very noisy environments, this adaptor for the 3M Peltor WS LiteCom headset provides a stable mounting of the M-Series Smart Glasses main unit and its battery. Includes both the left and right side mounts.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865740751014,"sku":"446T0A029","price":19.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/3M_Headset_Mount_Peltor.jpg?v=1684273053"},{"product_id":"m-series-ear-hooks","title":"M-Series Ear Hooks (For Lens-Less Frames)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eReplacement ear-hooks for the M-Series Lensless Frames provide a customized snug fit for all head sizes, stabilizing the frames on the head and preventing slippage when using in a head down position.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865741668518,"sku":"446T0A019","price":9.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/M_Series_Ear_Hooks.jpg?v=1628086968"},{"product_id":"m400-usb-a-to-usb-ccharging-cable-1-meter","title":"Vuzix M400™ USB-A to USB-C Charging Cable 1 meter","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eUSB-A to USB-C Viewer Cable is a 1 meter cable designed to charge an M-Series Power Bank from a laptop or wall adapter (not included).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865741897894,"sku":"472T0A004","price":19.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/M400_USB_A_to_USB_C_Charging_Cable_1meter.jpg?v=1628086970"},{"product_id":"m400-usb-c-to-usb-c-viewer-cable-16-inch","title":"Vuzix M400™ USB-C to USB-C Viewer Cable 16\"","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUSB-C to USB-C Viewer Cable is a 16\" cable designed to run an M-Series device with its included Power Bank.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865742028966,"sku":"472T0A003","price":24.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/M400_USB_C_to_USB_C_Viewer_Cable_16inc.jpg?v=1628086971"},{"product_id":"m-series-safety-helmet-mounts","title":"M-Series Safety Helmet Mounts (L\u0026R)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eThe M-Series Safety Helmet Mounts include both left and right side mounts that attach to the standard accessory mounting slots on either side of the helmet. Mounts allow for 30 degree rotation of Smart Glasses and fit most standard US and EU safety helmets. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eHelmet not included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865742225574,"sku":"446T0A007","price":19.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/M-Series-Safety-Helmet-Mounts.png?v=1628086973"},{"product_id":"m-series-safety-frame-kit-prescription-ready","title":"M-Series Safety Frame Kit (Prescription Ready)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eM-Series safety frames include left and right side clips with the custom Vuzix rail mounting system, allowing for right or left eye mounting with 30 degree rotation of the M-Series Smart Glasses main unit. Shipped with prescription blanks, these frames can be fitted for safety rated prescriptions by most optometrists. Additional accessories include a comfort nose bridge, dust guard, and temple head strap for a snug fit.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cem\u003eSmart Glasses not included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Small","offer_id":40865743569062,"sku":"446T0A022","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Medium","offer_id":40865743601830,"sku":"446T0A001","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Large","offer_id":40865743634598,"sku":"446T0A023","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/M-Series-Safety-Frame-Kit.png?v=1628086990"},{"product_id":"m-series-lens-less-frames","title":"M-Series Lensless Frames","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp id=\"product-description\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eReplacement frames can accommodate both the M-Series Smart Glasses and M-Series On-Frame Battery for either right or left eye mounting via the custom Vuzix rail mounting system on both temples. Designed with an adjustable tall nose bridge and no lenses, these frames allow the user to wear them over most pairs of prescription or safety eyewear. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eSmart Glasses not included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865744126118,"sku":"446T0A010","price":59.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/access.png?v=1628086993"},{"product_id":"m-series-headband","title":"M-Series Headband","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAdjustable Headband fits any head size comfortably while providing a stable mounting of the M-Series Smart Glasses. Elastic headband is lined for comfort, and holds an M-Series On-Frame Battery mount on one side and a single custom Vuzix rail mount on the other side, allowing for left or right eye use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSmart Glasses not included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41738877862054,"sku":"446T0A002","price":49.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/ScreenShot2021-11-18at9.04.57AM.png?v=1637247950"},{"product_id":"hat-mount","title":"M-Series Hat Mount","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eM-Series Hat Mounts are designed for comfort and versatility. They fit most baseball caps, visors, and safety bump caps providing a stable mounting for M-Series Smart Glasses. They can hold several M-Series On-Frame Battery types on one side and a single custom Vuzix rail mount on the other. The mounts rotate 360 degrees allowing use of M-Series Smart Glasses with either the left or right eye.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43111750434982,"sku":"446T0A038","price":19.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/ScreenShot2022-07-15at10.17.52AM.png?v=1657898381"},{"product_id":"m-series-elastic-headband-accessory-standard","title":"M-Series Comfort Headband","description":"\u003cp\u003eDesigned for all-day wear in situations not requiring alternative head protection, the Vuzix Comfort Headband is adjustable for a variety of head sizes and positions. Complete with rail mounts for easy attachment of the Vuzix M-Series glasses and any compatible head-mounted battery on either side, this cushioned headband keeps your smart glasses perfectly balanced and stable.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Standard","offer_id":43647313674406,"sku":"472T0A015","price":49.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/Pro-CaptureOne2175-grey.png?v=1724436104"},{"product_id":"4800mah-extended-use-power-bank","title":"4800 mAh Extended Use Power Bank","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe 4800mAh Extended Use Power Bank is designed for all-day shifts and assignments where a backup isn’t an option. Compatible with all M-Series products, it features the easy-to-use rail mounting design that supports Vuzix’ unique hot-swap capabilities, meaning you never need to interrupt your work when changing out the battery. With operating temperatures ranging from 0C\/32F to 45C\/114F, this battery is excellent for use in the freezer or on the line.\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43647324389542,"sku":"472T0A009","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/DSC_2026-Edit.jpg?v=1666652061"},{"product_id":"z100-usb-a-to-magnetic-charging-cable-3","title":"Vuzix Z100® USB-A to Magnetic Charging Cable, 3’","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eUSB-A to Magnetic Charging Cable is a 3 feet cable designed specifically for the Vuzix Z100® (not included).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44813613367462,"sku":"515T0A002","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/Cable3.jpg?v=1707925670"},{"product_id":"3200mah-xtreme-weather-power-bank","title":"3200mAh Xtreme Weather Power Bank","description":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe M-Series Xtreme Weather power bank is built to withstand the harshest workplace environments, with operating temperatures ranging from -20℃\/-4℉ to 45℃\/113℉. This lightweight battery has an IP67 rating against dust and water immersion and packs plenty of power for long assignments. Compatible with all M-Series products, it features the easy-to-use rail mounting design that supports Vuzix’ unique hot-swap capabilities, meaning you never need to interrupt your work when changing out the battery.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIncluded in the M400 Xtreme Kit.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45720908595366,"sku":"536T0A001","price":49.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/3200RotationLow-Right.2477_de65d05e-77bb-4a60-aed9-a69b3edea147.png?v=1723152057"},{"product_id":"bump-cap","title":"LX1 Bump Cap","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Vuzix bump cap is a lightweight, comfortable head protection solution designed for environments where minor bumps and scrapes are a risk, but a full hard hat isn’t required. Featuring a durable inner shell and a stylish outer cap, it blends safety with everyday wearability. Compatible with Vuzix M400 and LX1 hat-clip mounts, the bump cap is ideal for warehouses, maintenance work, and low-risk industrial settings.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56389759107238,"sku":"516T0A013","price":49.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/DSC00269.jpg?v=1776347602"},{"product_id":"lx1-7ah-battery-pack","title":"LX1 Long-Shift Power Bank","description":"\u003cdiv aria-setsize=\"-1\" id=\"message-list_1776450854.717129\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv aria-roledescription=\"message\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eThe LX1 Long-Shift 7000 mAh battery Power Bank is engineered to keep your team running even in harsh conditions. Designed for durability, it performs reliably in extreme temperatures ranging from -20°C (-4°F) to 45°C (113°F). It features a convenient slide-and-snap mounting system for quick, secure attachment to your LX1 smart glasses. Delivering dependable, all-shift power, it’s the ideal solution for warehouse teams and field technicians who need uninterrupted performance wherever the job takes them.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56389773492390,"sku":"516T0A001","price":119.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/DSC00370_c24e3a9f-de05-4b42-abf8-87c858b9977b.jpg?v=1776347790"},{"product_id":"lx1-4-bank-charger-cradle","title":"LX1 Charger Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eKeep your team powered for the day with this high-efficiency multi-charger for the Vuzix LX1 7000 mAh battery. Capable of charging up to four batteries simultaneously, each charging slot features a clear LED light indicator, so you always know when batteries are ready for use. This reliable charging solution ensures your devices stay operational throughout the workday.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes 4 bank charger, AC\/DC adapter, AC power cord (115V 60HZ Type A), and user manual.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe rated charger input is 12VDC 4A, output is 4.2VDC 2A.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe charger must be used with included Vuzix approved UL Listed AC adapter model ADP-48GR.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56409393037478,"sku":"516T0A020","price":199.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/DSC00380.jpg?v=1776348078"},{"product_id":"lx1-hat-mount","title":"LX1 Hat Mount","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eLX1 Hat Mount Clips are designed for all-day comfort. They easily attach to most baseball caps, visors, and safety bump caps, providing a secure and stable mounting solution for LX1 Smart Glasses.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003eBuilt for versatility, the clips feature a lightweight, low-profile design that maintains balance while keeping your device firmly in place during active use. The mounting system allows for smooth positioning and adjustment, so users can quickly adapt their setup for optimal viewing.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56433622089894,"sku":"516T0A004","price":14.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/DSC00365.jpg?v=1777651671"}],"url":"https:\/\/www.vuzix.com\/collections\/accessories.oembed","provider":"Vuzix Corporation","version":"1.0","type":"link"}